  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "50196319",
      "title": "How LLMs Use Tools",
      "sourceHash": "207affef7e95d487faa51cb1f3abb54f996ad8fdcaf3781c31db8b668b60d4aa",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.239,
          "end": 3.139,
          "en": "So all these AI chatbots, or at least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.139,
          "end": 5.199,
          "en": "some of them, can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.739,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "certain amounts of tools. For example, they",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.659,
          "end": 11.599,
          "en": "may be able to search the web. They also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.679,
          "end": 14.639,
          "en": "may be able to write and execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.639,
          "end": 17.399,
          "en": "code. They could always write code because it's just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.44,
          "end": 20.339,
          "en": "text, but they may also be able to take that code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.659,
          "end": 23.559,
          "en": "some Python code for example, and execute it, which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.6,
          "end": 26.019,
          "en": "can be helpful for solving certain math",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.059,
          "end": 28.739,
          "en": "problems, for example. So, they can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.819,
          "end": 31.739,
          "en": "have access to certain tools. How does this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.799,
          "end": 34.5,
          "en": "actually work? Well, what's not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.52,
          "end": 37.159,
          "en": "happening, and that is really important to understand, what's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.259,
          "end": 39.939,
          "en": "not happening is that there is some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.099,
          "end": 42.479,
          "en": "magical AI entity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.979,
          "end": 45.559,
          "en": "that, on its own, opens a web",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.559,
          "end": 48.459,
          "en": "browser, visits a website, searches for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.5,
          "end": 51.479,
          "en": "information, reads the website and gives you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.479,
          "end": 54.019,
          "en": "a response. That's not what's happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 57.359,
          "en": "The AI models, the large language models are still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.36,
          "end": 60.099,
          "en": "token prediction machines. They can't use a web",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.119,
          "end": 62.939,
          "en": "browser or anything else. What's instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.939,
          "end": 65.539,
          "en": "happening is that we have this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.659,
          "end": 68.519,
          "en": "shell, the ChatGPT application, for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.559,
          "end": 71.479,
          "en": "example, to which you send your input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.919,
          "end": 74.879,
          "en": "and which then talks to the AI model, so to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.879,
          "end": 76.959,
          "en": "say, or which triggers the AI model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.779,
          "end": 80.599,
          "en": "Now, what's happening here is that we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.619,
          "end": 83.07900000000001,
          "en": "this chat history, and into this history,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.519,
          "end": 85.819,
          "en": "the application is inserting some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.179,
          "end": 88.839,
          "en": "invisible messages, just as we have the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.919,
          "end": 91.719,
          "en": "invisible system prompt. Into that system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.779,
          "end": 94.759,
          "en": "prompt, or maybe as an additional message thereafter, doesn't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.779,
          "end": 97.63900000000001,
          "en": "matter, it may insert an extra message like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.63900000000001,
          "end": 100.479,
          "en": "\"Hey, you are an AI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.499,
          "end": 103.179,
          "en": "assistant, and you can use the following",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.179,
          "end": 105.939,
          "en": "tools if you think you need to,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.419,
          "end": 108.85900000000001,
          "en": "and then maybe a list of tools like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.919,
          "end": 112.259,
          "en": "web_search:usethistool,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.339,
          "end": 113.09899999999999,
          "en": "by outputting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.219,
          "end": 115.59899999999999,
          "en": "web_search:query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.37899999999999,
          "end": 120.059,
          "en": "With this extra information that's now part of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.099,
          "end": 123.059,
          "en": "context window, it's more likely,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.139,
          "end": 125.699,
          "en": "due to how this model was trained also,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.259,
          "end": 128.719,
          "en": "that when it encounters a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.779,
          "end": 131.539,
          "en": "certain problem for which it would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.599,
          "end": 134.399,
          "en": "useful to search the web, it does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.539,
          "end": 137.379,
          "en": "not come up with some made-up information and it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.399,
          "end": 140.279,
          "en": "does not reply with, \"Sorry, I don't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.339,
          "end": 143.219,
          "en": "that,\" but instead, it will output something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.299,
          "end": 146.199,
          "en": "like web_search: \"Who is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.219,
          "end": 148.359,
          "en": "the current president of the United States?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.279,
          "end": 152.25900000000001,
          "en": "However, that's now not the output you see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.279,
          "end": 155.099,
          "en": "because remember, the output generated by the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.179,
          "end": 157.859,
          "en": "large language model is not directly shown on your",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 157.939,
          "end": 160.75900000000001,
          "en": "screen. It's first handed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.799,
          "end": 163.579,
          "en": "over to the ChatGPT application, and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.619,
          "end": 166.599,
          "en": "that application sees that the output starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.639,
          "end": 169.199,
          "en": "with web_search:, which is an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.25900000000001,
          "end": 172.179,
          "en": "identifier that was set up in the system prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.519,
          "end": 175.339,
          "en": "that tells the application that some web search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.399,
          "end": 178.239,
          "en": "needs to be performed. So what's happening now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.279,
          "end": 180.979,
          "en": "is that the application, which again, was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.999,
          "end": 182.939,
          "en": "written by OpenAI developers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.439,
          "end": 186.339,
          "en": "triggers a, a function, a code block, that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.339,
          "end": 189.159,
          "en": "was also written by OpenAI software engineers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.519,
          "end": 191.839,
          "en": "that performs the actual web search.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.339,
          "end": 195.25900000000001,
          "en": "So some code is executed that was written by OpenAI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.339,
          "end": 198.119,
          "en": "people, or whatever company we're talking about, and that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 198.199,
          "end": 201.139,
          "en": "code gets the query that was defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.179,
          "end": 203.459,
          "en": "by the large language model, then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.999,
          "end": 206.839,
          "en": "executes some code to go to Google, search the web,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.859,
          "end": 209.719,
          "en": "find some webpages and extract the content from that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.75900000000001,
          "end": 212.239,
          "en": "pages, and that content is then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.619,
          "end": 215.179,
          "en": "handed back into the chat history,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.299,
          "end": 218.25900000000001,
          "en": "again, as a invisible message, which you don't see as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.279,
          "end": 221.139,
          "en": "the user. So the model then gets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.159,
          "end": 224.059,
          "en": "this updated chat history, where it sees that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.099,
          "end": 226.75900000000001,
          "en": "it asked for a web search and that it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.879,
          "end": 229.739,
          "en": "got the web search results, and it's now able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.91899999999998,
          "end": 232.719,
          "en": "to use these web search results in combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.739,
          "end": 235.659,
          "en": "with the original user input and produce",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.719,
          "end": 238.639,
          "en": "a meaningful response. That",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.679,
          "end": 241.439,
          "en": "is how this process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.699,
          "end": 244.479,
          "en": "works. That is how these LLMs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 244.779,
          "end": 247.579,
          "en": "these AI models, can use tools. They don't do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.599,
          "end": 250.059,
          "en": "themselves. Instead, they're told by the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 250.099,
          "end": 253.079,
          "en": "application in which they run which tools they may",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 253.119,
          "end": 256.039,
          "en": "access and how they should communicate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.259,
          "end": 259.219,
          "en": "if they wanna access a certain tool. Because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 259.239,
          "end": 262.139,
          "en": "of that information in the context window, they are then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 262.279,
          "end": 264.779,
          "en": "more likely to output tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 265.299,
          "end": 267.839,
          "en": "that describe this tool use when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 268.439,
          "end": 271.179,
          "en": "the overall combination of input makes it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 271.239,
          "end": 273.959,
          "en": "likely that such a tool should be used, also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 273.959,
          "end": 276.739,
          "en": "based on how they were trained and fine-tuned, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.399,
          "end": 280.119,
          "en": "and then the final output you as a user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 280.159,
          "end": 282.599,
          "en": "see is the result of this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 282.879,
          "end": 285.619,
          "en": "overall process. But they're not using tools themselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 285.779,
          "end": 288.759,
          "en": "It's the application that contains the tool use code, and it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 288.759,
          "end": 291.359,
          "en": "the configuration of the models through the system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.439,
          "end": 294.379,
          "en": "prompt that, in the end, ensures that they are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 294.719,
          "end": 297.379,
          "en": "likely, not guaranteed, but likely to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 297.55899999999997,
          "end": 300.199,
          "en": "ask for those tools for certain kinds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 300.499,
          "end": 303.399,
          "en": "of input. That's how they use tools, and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 303.419,
          "end": 306.359,
          "en": "that's the same no matter if we're talking about web search,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 306.559,
          "end": 309.319,
          "en": "code execution, or any other kind of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 309.339,
          "end": 311.459,
          "en": "tool, and it's important to understand it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 311.859,
          "end": 314.599,
          "en": "We're not talking about supercomputers here that can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 314.699,
          "end": 317.259,
          "en": "roam the internet on their own. Instead, they're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 317.279,
          "end": 319.859,
          "en": "doing what they're told to do in this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 319.879,
          "end": 322.659,
          "en": "controlled environment, in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 322.839,
          "end": 324.699,
          "en": "in this shell in which they're running.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
